          "content": "根据检查结果，我已找到\"过载场景未产生预期拒绝\"的根本原因及解决方案：\n\n### 问题根源\n1. **队列填充不足**：\n   - 虽然第一个线程池配置了小队列（size=2）\n   - 但测试中提交的任务数`TASKS_PER_POOL=5000`远大于队列容量\n   - 由于任务执行太快（`Thread.sleep(TASK_DELAY_MS)`仅5ms），队列来不及填满\n\n2. **任务执行速度过快**：\n   ```java\n   Thread.sleep(TASK_DELAY_MS); // 仅5ms延迟\n   ```\n\n### 修复方案\n修改`testMultiPoolResourceIsolation()`方法：\n\n```java\n@Test\npublic void testMultiPoolResourceIsolation() throws InterruptedException {\n    // 1. 获取测试用线程池\n    int testPoolIdx = 0;\n    ThreadPoolExecutor rawPool = (ThreadPoolExecutor) \n        NewThreadPoolExecutorUtil.unwrapExecutor(threadPools.get(testPoolIdx));\n    \n    // 2. 打印初始状态\n    log.info(\"线程池状态 - core:{}, max:{}, queue:{}/{}\", \n        rawPool.getCorePoolSize(),\n        rawPool.getMaximumPoolSize(),\n        rawPool.getQueue().size(),\n        rawPool.getQueue().remainingCapacity());\n\n    // 3. 提交阻塞性任务填满队列\n    CountDownLatch blockLatch = new CountDownLatch(1);\n    for (int i = 0; i < rawPool.getMaximumPoolSize() + rawPool.getQueue().size(); i++) {\n        rawPool.execute(() -> {\n            try {\n                blockLatch.await(); // 永久阻塞\n            } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n                Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    // 4. 验证队列已满\n    assertTrue(\"队列未填满\", \n        rawPool.getQueue().remainingCapacity() == 0);\n    assertEquals(\"活跃线程应全忙\",\n        rawPool.getMaximumPoolSize(), rawPool.getActiveCount());\n\n    // 5. 提交新任务触发拒绝\n    try {\n        rawPool.execute(() -> {});\n        fail(\"应触发拒绝但未触发\");\n    } catch (RejectedExecutionException e) {\n        log.info(\"成功触发拒绝: {}\", e.getMessage());\n    } finally {\n        blockLatch.countDown(); // 释放阻塞任务\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 关键修改点\n1. **使用阻塞任务填满队列**：\n   ```java\n   blockLatch.await(); // 永久阻塞直到测试结束\n   ```\n\n2. **精确控制任务数量**：\n   ```java\n   rawPool.getMaximumPoolSize() + rawPool.getQueue().size()\n   ```\n\n3. **即时验证拒绝**：\n   ```java\n   try {\n       rawPool.e